          "section": "us_news",
          "raw_content": "No trackers, no ads. Black type, white background. Privacy policy: we don't collect or retain any data at all ever period. Gary K Wolf is the author of a fantastic 1981 novel called Who Censored Roger Rabbit? which Disney licensed and turned into an equally fantastic 1988 live action/animated hybrid movie called Who Framed Roger Rabbit? But despite the commercial and critical acclaim of the movie, Disney hasn't made any feature-length sequels.",
